  data: {
    LLM: "Only go 'in' with a pair or Ace-high. The risk of matching the pot is enormous.\n\nPot Odds Calculation: If the pot is $100 and you have a 50% chance to win, you're risking $100 to win $100. You need better than 50% to make it profitable.\n\nBluffing: In games with experienced players, going 'in' with a weak hand can sometimes scare others into going 'out', winning you the pot uncontested. But this is extremely risky.",
